  "format": 1,
  "note": "Track B2 (docs/build.md 'Java blocks', ADR 0125): Java block ids and states -> Bedrock block names and states, read by java.ts. rename: Java ids whose Bedrock name differs. patterns: regex renames tried after rename, in order. byState: a Java state that picks another Bedrock block (a lit furnace, smoker or blast furnace is built unlit: the lit block has no item). states: rules by Java id (regex), in order; for each Java property the first rule whose Bedrock state the block has (by the game's block palette) wins; values map Java strings to Bedrock values, or 'same' (the string as it is), 'bool' (true 1, false 0), 'not' (true 0, false 1), 'int', 'int-1'. set: Bedrock states set whatever the Java states. legacy: MCEdit numeric ids -> Java block states (java.ts legacyToJava). javaIds: the Java block ids the guard test maps (written from Java 1.21.x, not read from a Java registry).",
